{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07470","headline":"温汤客舍 · 刘长卿","name":"温汤客舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬狩温泉岁欲阑，宫城佳气晚宜看。\n汤熏仗里千旗暖，雪照山边万井寒。\n君门献赋谁相达，客舍无钱輙自安。\n且喜礼闱秦镜在，还将妍丑付春官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}